ce; memory must reconcile against current source-of-record values."}', 'captain_activation', 'captain-roster-standup', 0.9, 'active', 'captain_activation:KY4TG:2026-05-04', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-04T00:00:00Z', '2026-05-04T00:00:00Z');

